## Ⅱ. WHY ANCIENT LANGUAGES

### Reason 1: Universal Comprehension
```
ANY PERSON IN THE WORLD CAN USE THIS ORGANISM.
No mode switching. No language barriers.
The fundamentals are universal.

Ancient symbols predate modern language divisions.
𓂀 means "see/watch" whether you speak English or Mandarin.
```

### Reason 2: Noise Reduction
```
FUNDAMENTALS = DATA
DETAILS = METADATA  
NOISE = DISCARDED

Modern language is noisy.
Ancient language is signal.
Focus on fundamentals → then detail.
Focus on details first → stupid answers.

基础第一，细节随后。
الأساسيات أولاً، التفاصيل ثانياً.
```

### Reason 3: Internal Consistency
```
When organism thinks, it uses ONE language.
When organism talks to other organisms, it uses ONE language.
When organism stores memory, it uses ONE language.

Glyph-based. Symbol-based. Frequency-based.
Consistent from input to storage to output.
```

### Reason 4: Compression Power
```
Modern: "Five thousand employees working for twenty years"
Glyph:  𓀀⁵⁰⁰⁰ 𓇳²⁰

11 words → 2 symbols
The ancients knew: in brevity, power.
```

