## Ⅷ. IMPLEMENTATION FOR STUDENTS

### What the Student Must Understand
```
1. The organism thinks in symbols, not words.
2. Translation happens at the boundaries only.
3. Compression is power. 5000 → 𓀀⁵⁰⁰⁰
4. Fundamentals first, details second.
5. All languages converge to one internal language.
6. This allows ANY human to use the organism.
```

### How to Implement
```
1. BUILD input sandbox (world → glyph)
2. BUILD output sandbox (glyph → world)
3. DEFINE glyph vocabulary for your domain
4. MAP business concepts → glyphs
5. STORE everything as glyph + coordinate
6. EXPAND only when outputting to humans
```

